  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - National Medical Products Administration (NVMPA), through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting a training program to bring senior Chinese officials from the National Medical Products Administration to the United States for training on policies and procedures related to improving the efficiency of the review and approval of medical devices. The training program will be supported by members of the U.S.-China Healthcare Cooperation Program.</narrative>
  </description>
